{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "ea6da8b537f6db747aa56df8250bf40e82e2ab553b10d7dee4e30dcb0a978f43", "ja": "もしかして、アイドルのみんなの衣装づくりも\nAIがぜーんぶ決めちゃったり……？", "zh": "难道说，偶像们的服装也全都由AI决定……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "63070913f675505015d6d9d9c911adfd6ba95c8c2b867f6cdca9edbab6134059", "ja": "そ、それは困るなぁ～。まだまだみんなのために\n仕立てたい衣装のアイディアは山ほど……！", "zh": "那、那可就麻烦了～我还有好多好多想为大家量身定制的服装创意呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ea270589d72fe9f0a99dd8facdbd4ae94679a9ab9bb03c36aa20df6876ffdefe", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。なんだか\n深刻そうな雰囲気ですけど、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。总觉得气氛有些沉重，您没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "1b3e574dff60e1175f5fed6ca9ac300bcc02c85d2c488799b38ca5945a3b2370", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　いえ、これはただ、\n未来への漠然とした不安が……あ、その書類は？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！不，没什么，只是对未来莫名的不安……啊，那份文件是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7847be8097b5befbe6efd73ed2475aaa32f27a3644910f00ea327a1f5555e1b6", "ja": "ああ、これは次のイベントの企画書です。青羽さんも\nよくご存じの、『ココロ』を学ぶAIたちの……。", "zh": "啊，这是下次活动的企划书。是关于那些学习“心”的AI……青羽小姐也很熟悉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "8146e9bd7ff94799520f7732e2058da9a179122a60bc03836b263bb360560471", "ja": "AI！？　や、やっぱり、劇場にも技術革新の波が……\nん？　『ココロ』を学ぶ……それって、もしかして！", "zh": "AI！？难、难道说，剧场也迎来了技术革新的浪潮……\n嗯？学习“心”……那岂不是，难道说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2a766489d6800cf48409ff23bd441f2fa7ce785e4cc75a25e00e8529e4d714bb", "ja": "はい、あのユニットです。もう一度、アンドロイドの\n彼女たちを起動することになりそうで。", "zh": "对，就是那个组合。看来，我们又要启动她们这些仿生人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "1bb51ed98c24561ec45d7e887d9f5435693888a3fa48a8b6563175d2ccb5c272", "ja": "わあ、やっぱり♪　あの子たちのためなら、\n私も全力でお手伝いします！", "zh": "哇，果然是♪如果是为了那些孩子们，\n我也一定会全力帮忙的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "93c2bf3b26ce64cf94f7ab56f525c7dc0021dc3aada5b259b383c4d69348030d", "ja": "それは助かります。それじゃあ打ち合わせのため、\n今から事務所に行ってきますね！", "zh": "那真是帮大忙了。那么为了商量细节，我现在就去事务所啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "99a4effbe0833a0bfbf7949c353a64f27b2e52c33efe88f58b5214bdd7065640", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃーい！　変な心配よりも、\nまずは目の前のお仕事を頑張らなくっちゃ♪", "zh": "好的，路上小心——！与其担心那些奇怪的事，还是先努力完成眼前的工作吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "f925d4a407898de05ec95b82a8e729aa5c05889e1e0f5e74efddce52aca5c36e", "ja": "やあ君、よく来てくれたね。\n企画書にはもう目を通してくれたことだろう。", "zh": "你来啦，欢迎欢迎。\n策划书你应该已经看过了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "9b48864568612731553c0c4d8446931820fbe38592b83dd4675627ce01d43485", "ja": "白石紬君、北沢志保君、真壁瑞希君によるユニット、\n『EScape』のファンイベントの開催が決まった！", "zh": "由白石䌷、北泽志保、真壁瑞希组成的组合『EScape』，粉丝活动确定举办了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "2f0e5f234c41841d884cc455794663e300142460ea15634ec603884c162c72e2", "ja": "アンドロイドを演じる3人がハマり役で、\nまさしく『クール系美少女ユニット』でしたよね～♪", "zh": "饰演安卓的3人非常适合这个角色，简直就是“冷酷系美少女组合”呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6e1d7499c5efa25ddfd6094ebc5df6cdefba0c130cbdccf8ffdd419474c5d518", "ja": "……そうですね、まさしく！", "zh": "……是啊，确实如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "ce2e79fa6c78d19882ff60794dd376dc0747bc7052224975642806afd7c22326", "ja": "SF設定の盛り込まれたPVにも熱烈なファンが\nついていて、根強い人気って聞きますし！", "zh": "融入了科幻设定的PV也吸引了热烈的粉丝，\n听说一直以来都有着根深蒂固的人气呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "73113b69e50c43582b70a99bf72687f0458edd89896d508620581a9d42e2e402", "ja": "はい。いまだに反響が届くくらいですから。\nそろそろのタイミングだと自分も考えていました。", "zh": "是的。直到现在还不断收到反响。\n我也觉得差不多是时候了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "fd7847da362e9df4886152b47923ac5301a29140ac7c5f5478d85aa7b766ef19", "ja": "うむ。もう一度、アンドロイドの彼女たちに\n会いたいと願うファンたちへ向けて……。", "zh": "嗯。面向那些希望能够\n再次与仿生人她们相见的粉丝们……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "f6e36d1cee217bb6212525998c1860f7f8792ccc8b356d239cda3889c1158139", "ja": "ぜひとも、このイベントを成功させてほしい！\nやってもらえるかね？", "zh": "务必要让这次活动成功！\n能拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_1020", "source_sha256": "9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3", "ja": "もちろんです！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a79bbc0fb437b259ea0ac321a4a91ab7a3b0c00562701141cb69a2cebcaa7090", "ja": "もちろんです！　クール系美少女ユニットの\n再起動、成功させてみせます！", "zh": "当然！我一定会让酷系美少女组合成功重启！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "e3972836784e3627b4c6a16298b9acf06faf5c73ef52aa55de49d066fe6e6006", "ja": "ふふっ、クールに決めちゃってくださいね、\nクール系プロデューサーさん！", "zh": "呵呵，请务必帅气地展现出冷酷风范哦，冷酷系制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "6f5b241544786327bc448a200fc8dec621a584caae11dcee63c884c197bc386d", "ja": "（そうと決まったら早速動かないと。台本の用意に、\n会場の下見、告知内容も詰めて……やる事は多いぞ！）", "zh": "（既然决定了就得马上行动。准备剧本、提前查看会场、敲定宣传内容……要做的事可多着呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
